<title>USA: Thai Capital Fund Inc annual dividend.</title>
<headline>Thai Capital Fund Inc annual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Thai Capital Fund Inc said on Wednesday the per share amount of its annual dividend will be determined by fund's management on or before Dec 26.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable in cash Jan 17, 1997, to holders of record Dec 31.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend consists substantially of all the fund's undistributed net investment income and net realized currency gains, short-term and long-term gains as well as other factors.</p>
</text>
